{
  "name": "progressive rendering · formatString 中 undefined 转空串",
  "description": "验证规范原文明文条款：'formatString type conversion —— Null/Undefined: An empty string \"\"'（a2ui_protocol.md §formatString type conversion）。当 formatString 插值中路径解析为 undefined 时，该段展开必须替换为空字符串，而非 'undefined' / 'null' / 路径字符串本身。用例覆盖 4 种混合模式：(1) 缺失路径夹在已存在路径之间；(2) 首尾都缺失；(3) 连续两个缺失路径相邻；(4) 缺失路径出现在 formatString 的括号函数参数里。dataModel 只提供 /a=foo /b=bar，其它路径故意留空。",
  "messages": [
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "createSurface": {
        "surfaceId": "db-pr-5",
        "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "updateComponents": {
        "surfaceId": "db-pr-5",
        "components": [
          { "id": "root", "component": "Card", "child": "col" },
          {
            "id": "col",
            "component": "Column",
            "children": [
              "title",
              "label_mid", "t_mid",
              "label_edge", "t_edge",
              "label_adj", "t_adj",
              "label_fn", "t_fn",
              "footer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "title",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "formatString: undefined 段应替换为空串",
            "variant": "h5"
          },
          {
            "id": "label_mid",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "① 缺失夹在中间：'[${/a}][${/gap}][${/b}]'",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_mid",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": { "value": "[${/a}][${/gap}][${/b}]" },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "label_edge",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "② 首尾都缺失：'[${/lead}]-body-[${/trail}]'",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_edge",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": { "value": "[${/lead}]-body-[${/trail}]" },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "label_adj",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "③ 相邻缺失：'x${/m1}${/m2}y'",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_adj",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": { "value": "x${/m1}${/m2}y" },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "label_fn",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "④ 函数参数里的缺失：'up=${formatString(value:\"pre-${/none}-post\")}'",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_fn",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": { "value": "up=${formatString(value:'pre-${/none}-post')}" },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "footer",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "期望：① '[foo][][bar]'；② '[]-body-[]'；③ 'xy'；④ 'up=pre--post'。任何 undefined 字面量出现即失败。",
            "variant": "caption"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "updateDataModel": {
        "surfaceId": "db-pr-5",
        "value": {
          "a": "foo",
          "b": "bar"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
